<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1516011" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "03" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Oil Pump Inspection
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A1516010">Oil Pump Assembly Disassembly and Reassembly:K14C</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1516011001">
<title>
Oil Seal
</title>
<ptxt>
Check oil seal lip for defects and damage. Replace it if necessary.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "I2RH0B150023.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "51.085mm" ver = "01" gw = "184" gh = "128"/>
</figure>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1516011002">
<title>
Oil Pump
</title>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Check outer rotor (1), inner rotor (2), rotor plate and timing chain cover for excessive wear or damage.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A150045.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "47.999mm" ver = "01" gw = "169" gh = "120"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "2" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
3.
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
Front mark
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check that relief valve (1) is not excessively worn or damaged and operates smoothly.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A150047.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "54.770mm" ver = "01" gw = "157" gh = "139"/>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
<topic id = "AENLSB0A1516011003">
<title>
Radial clearance
</title>
<ptxt>
Check radial clearance between outer rotor (1) and timing chain cover (2) using feeler gauge (3).
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If clearance is out of specification, replace oil pump assembly.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Radial clearance between outer rotor and timing chain cover
</title>
<ptxt>
Standard: 0.265 – 0.335 mm (0.0104 – 0.0131 in.)
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Limit: 0.355 mm (0.0139 in.)
</ptxt>
</spec>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A150048.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "54.603mm" ver = "01" gw = "194" gh = "138"/>
</figure>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0A1516011004">
<title>
Side clearance
</title>
<ptxt>
Using straightedge (1) and feeler gauge (2), measure side clearance.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If side clearance is out of specification, replace oil pump assembly.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Side clearance of oil pump inner rotor
</title>
<ptxt>
Standard: 0.03 – 0.08 mm (0.0011 – 0.0031 in.)
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Limit: 0.10 mm (0.0039 in.)
</ptxt>
</spec>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A150049.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "47.867mm" ver = "02" gw = "190" gh = "119"/>
</figure>
</topic>
<topic id = "AENLSB0A1516011005">
<title>
Relief valve spring free length and load
</title>
<ptxt>
Check free length and load of relief valve spring as shown in figure. If any of measurement is smaller than specification, replace relief valve spring.
</ptxt>
<spec>
